GET /v2/report/meetings/{meetingId}
Retrieve ended meeting details report
Required: meetingId (path) — The meeting ID or meeting UUID. If given meeting ID, will take the last meeting instance.

GET /v2/report/webinars/{webinarId}
Retrieve ended webinar details report
Required: webinarId (path) — The webinar ID or webinar UUID. If given webinar ID, will take the last webinar instance.
